<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Votorantim started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Votorantim started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Pedro Martins started coverage of Brazil's Votorantim Inc Thursday with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The rating was based on the company's &quot;strategic placement&quot; in the Brazilian paper and forest products industry, its high-end sales mix, its attractive valuation and likely earnings growth, Martins wrote in a report.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
